<http://example.org/analysis/solution/4> a dctype:Software ;
    rdfs:label "Centralised data and analytics"@en ;
    lomo:establishedIn <https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/943/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_943/FINAL/eng/art_1095>,
